  "title": "Sweet Salsa and Cinnamon Chips",
  "description": "Strawberries serve as a base for a salsa featuring fresh kiwi, mango, and banana to accompany some simple home-made cinnamon chips for a delightful summertime snack, best enjoyed outdoors under the sun.",
